      "title": "Turns whose transcript and thread parted company",
      "description": "The two records of one conversation: the transcript a chemist sees on reload, and the checkpoint the model is rebuilt from. A teardown between the two leaves the model holding an exchange the chemist cannot see. Counts one branch \u2014 a completed run that never answered \u2014 and deliberately not the whole class, so a flat line is not proof of agreement.",
